# Volkswagen Golf Mk5 five-door hatchback, 2004-2008.
#
# 4,204 mm long, 1,759 mm wide, 1,479 mm high, 2,578 mm wheelbase; 1.4-3.2
# petrol and 1.9/2.0 diesel.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk5
#
# Colours: Tornado Red, Reflex Silver, Black and Candy White are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 310 in total (red 85, silver 85, black 75, white 65).
#
# Speed 200 km/h; comfort 115/350 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2004-2008 with a road tail to about 2019.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk5.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk5/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

